{"message":"I can help with this, but I need to verify your identity before accessing or changing your accounts. Please provide your full name and any two of the following: date of birth, email address, phone number, or mailing address.

After verification, I’ll check your account eligibility and confirm whether there are any pending transactions or an early-closure fee on your Light Blue Account. Because you need an active checking account to open savings, we should generally open the replacement checking account before closing Light Blue.

For your goals, the Bluest Account has the strongest documented checking perks, including 2.25% APY, a dedicated personal banker, wire-fee benefits, and ATM rebates. For savings, the Gold Account has a documented 5.5% base APY and a $10,000 standard minimum balance, which your $25,000 deposit meets. The best effective rate may depend on the checking-account pairing and any eligible Rho-Bank credit card bonuses, so I’ll review those after verification. Please also tell me whether you prefer the Bluest Account for perks or a checking account specifically paired with the highest savings APY."}

